        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Surada, Odisha, India, Ganjam district, Bhanjanagar Sub-division\n- Organizations: Surada Block, Notified Area Council\n\nFacts:\n- Odisha, formerly called Orissa, is a state in eastern India.\n- Surada, also known as Sorada, Suruda, or Soroda, is a town in Ganjam district, Odisha, India.\n- Surada is a Notified Area Council.\n- Surada is the headquarters of Surada Block under the Bhanjanagar Sub-division.\n- Surada Block has an area of about 2663.89 km.",
